  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7305.02 Suspension or Termination of Loan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7305.02 Suspension or Termination of Loan. The director shall suspend or terminate the loan for filing false information affecting a local government’s eligibility for the loan in the application, a report, or document used in conjunction with this program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
